--&gt;&lt;noinclude&gt;{{dokumentacija}}&lt;/noinclude&gt;{{spódk dokumentacije}}
{{wužiwa lua|Module:root}}
This template is to be added in the first line of an etymology section. &lt;u&gt;It is meant to not display anything&lt;/u&gt;, and only serves the purpose of categorization.

===Parameters===
; {{para|1}}
: The language code (see [[Wikisłownik:Rěče]]) of the language which derived the root, which should be the language of the section that the template is placed in.
; {{para|2}}
: The language code of the language which the root was derived from.
; {{para|3}}, {{para|4}}, {{para|5}}, ...
: The root(s) in the source language that this term was derived from.
; {{para|id}}, {{para|id2}}, {{para|id3}}, ...
: {{qual|optional}} Sense ids for the roots; see {{předł|l}} and {{předł|m}}. {{para|id}} corresponds to {{para|3}}, {{para|id2}} corresponds to {{para|4}}, etc.

===Example===
On {{m+|en|draw}}:

 ===Etymology===
 {{tl|korjeń|en|ine-pro|*dʰregʰ-}}
 Ze {{tl|zdź|en|enm|drawen}} ...

which will categorize the page in [[:Category:English terms derived from the Proto-Indo-European root *dʰregʰ-]].

&lt;includeonly&gt;
[[Category:Morphology templates]]
&lt;/includeonly&gt;#REDIRECT [[Předłoha:přirunaj]]&lt;includeonly&gt;{{#invoke:etymology/templates|cognate}}&lt;/includeonly&gt;&lt;!--

--&gt;&lt;noinclude&gt;{{přir|und|test}}{{dokumentacija}}&lt;/noinclude&gt;{{safesubst:&lt;noinclude/&gt;#invoke:category tree|show}}&lt;noinclude&gt;{{dokumentacija}}&lt;/noinclude&gt;&lt;includeonly&gt;{{#invoke:links/templates|section_link_t}}&lt;/includeonly&gt;&lt;noinclude&gt;
{{dokumentacija}}
&lt;/noinclude&gt;&lt;includeonly&gt;{{#invoke:module categorization|categorize|is_template=1}}&lt;/includeonly&gt;&lt;noinclude&gt;
{{dokumentacija}}
&lt;/noinclude&gt;/* this is a block */
.multiimageinner {
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
}

.trow {
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: row;
	clear: left;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	width: 100%;
	box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* this is a cell */
.tsingle {
	margin: 1px;
	float: left;
}

.theader {
	clear: both;
	font-weight: bold;
	text-align: center;
	align-self: center;
	background-color: transparent;
	width: 100%;
}

.thumbcaption {
	background-color: transparent;
}

.text-align-left {
	text-align: left;
}

.text-align-right {
	text-align: right;
}

.text-align-center {
	text-align: center;
}

@media all and ( max-width: 720px ) {
	.thumbinner {
		/* not !important usage can be removed when these are no longer inline styles
		inside Template:Multiple image and media query using min-width is introduced */
		width: 100% !important;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		max-width: none !important;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.trow {
		justify-content: center;
	}
	.tsingle {
		/* not !important usage can be removed when these are no longer inline styles
		inside Template:Multiple image and media query using min-width is introduced */
	    float: none !important;
	    max-width: 100% !important;
	    box-sizing: border-box;
	    text-align: center;
	}
	.tsingle .thumbcaption {
		text-align: left;
	}
	.trow &gt; .thumbcaption {
		text-align: center;
	}
}{{#invoke:multiple images|render}}&lt;!--

--&gt;&lt;noinclude&gt;{{dokumentacija}}&lt;/noinclude&gt;{{spódk dokumentacije}}
{{skrót|Předłoha:wobrazy}}
This template creates a box with two to ten images arranged vertically or horizontally with captions for the entire box or for each image.

With the appropriate choice of parameters, the template can automatically resize images to a given total width with each image having the same height.

'''Be aware''' that this template does ''not'' respect users' default image size preferences. ([[w:Wikipedia:Image use policy]] states: {{Xt|&quot;'''Except with very good reason, do not use''' &lt;code&gt;px&lt;/code&gt;&quot;... &quot;'''which forces a fixed image width.''' In most cases {{nobr|1=&lt;code&gt;upright=''scaling factor''&lt;/code&gt;}} should be used, thereby respecting the user's base preference (which may have been selected for that user's particular devices).&quot;}})

If image size parameters are omitted, this template sets all images at 200px wide, regardless of whether the reader has set a preference for some other default image width. This causes wjacore wobrazy to look out of scale to the other images in an article.

===Syntaks a parametry===
;Žane awtomatiske připodobnjenje wulkosćow wšěch wobrazow na samsnu wysokosć
:&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
&lt;!-- Parametry wuhotowanja --&gt;
 | połoženje               = &lt;!-- right (standardowy), left, center, none --&gt;
 | směr                    = &lt;!-- horicontalny (standardowy), wertikalny --&gt;
 | pozadk                  = &lt;!-- barba boksy --&gt;
 | šěrokosć                = &lt;!-- pokazana šěrokosć kóždeho wobraza w pixelach (cyłoličba, sufiks &quot;px&quot; preč wostajić); přepisa &quot;šěrokosć[n]&quot;s deleka --&gt;
 | hłownaLinka_połoženje   = &lt;!-- left (standardowy), center, right --&gt;

&lt;!-- Hornja linka --&gt;
 | hornjaLinka_pozadk     = 
 | hornjaLinka_połoženje  = &lt;!-- center (standardowy), left, right --&gt;
 | hornjaLinka            = 

&lt;!-- Wobraz 1 --&gt;
 | wobraz1                 = &lt;!-- jenož datajowe mjeno, t.r. bjez prefiksa &quot;Dataja:&quot; --&gt;
 | šěrokosć1               = &lt;!-- pokazana šěrokosć wobraza; přepisachu přez &quot;šěrokosć&quot; horjeka --&gt;
 | alt1                    = 
 | link1                   = 
 | wopis1                  = 
&lt;!-- Wobraz 2 --&gt;
 | wobraz2                 = &lt;!-- jenož datajowe mjeno, t.r. bjez prefiksa &quot;Dataja:&quot; --&gt;
 | šěrokosć2               = &lt;!-- pokazana šěrokosć wobraza; přepisachu přez &quot;šěrokosć&quot; horjeka --&gt;
 | alt2                    = 
 | link2                   = 
 | wopis2                  = 
&lt;!-- a tak dale, hač do maksimalnje 10 wobrazow (wobraz10) --&gt;

&lt;!-- Spódnja  linka --&gt;
 | spódnjaLinka_pozadk     = 
 | spódnjaLinka_połoženje  = &lt;!-- center (standardowy), left, right --&gt;
 | spódnjaLinka            = 
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;

;Awtomatiske připodobnjenje wulkosćow wšitkich wobrazow na samsnu wysokosć a na wěstu cyłkownu šěrokosć
:&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
&lt;!-- Parametry wuhotowanja --&gt;
 | połoženje               = &lt;!-- right (standardowy), left, center, none --&gt;
 | směr                    = &lt;!-- horicontalny (standardowy), wertikalny --&gt;
 | pozadk                  = &lt;!-- barba boksy --&gt;
 | dospołna_šěrokosć       = &lt;!-- dospołna šěrokosć wšěch pokazanych wobrazow w pixelach (cyłoličba, sufiks &quot;px&quot; preč wostajić) --&gt;
 | hłownaLinka_połoženje   = &lt;!-- left (standardowy), center, right --&gt;

&lt;!-- Header --&gt;
 | hornjaLinka_pozadk     = 
 | hornjaLinka_połoženje  = &lt;!-- center (standardowy), left, right --&gt;
 | hornjaLinka            = 

&lt;!-- Wobraz 1 --&gt;
 | wobraz1                 = &lt;!-- jenož datajowe mjeno, t.r. bjez prefiksa &quot;Dataja:&quot; --&gt;
 | šěrokosć1               = &lt;!-- pokazana šěrokosć wobraza; přepisachu přez &quot;šěrokosć&quot; horjeka --&gt;
 | wysokosć1               = 
 | alt1                    = 
 | link1                   = 
 | wopis1                  = 
&lt;!-- Wobraz 2 --&gt;
 | wobraz2                 = &lt;!-- jenož datajowe mjeno, t.r. bjez prefiksa &quot;Dataja:&quot; --&gt;
 | šěrokosć2               = &lt;!-- pokazana šěrokosć wobraza; přepisachu přez &quot;šěrokosć&quot; horjeka --&gt;
 | wysokosć2               = 
 | alt2                    = 
 | link2                   = 
 | wopis2                  = 
&lt;!-- a tak dale, hač do maksimalnje 10 wobrazow (wobraz10) --&gt;

&lt;!-- Spódnja  linka --&gt;
 | spódnjaLinka_pozadk     = 
 | spódnjaLinka_połoženje  = &lt;!-- center (standardowy), left, right --&gt;
 | spódnjaLinka            = 
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;

===Prózdna předłoha===
&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
 | šěrokosć =
 | wobraz1 =
 | alt1 =
 | wobraz2 =
 | alt2 =
 | spódnjaLinka =
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;

===Examples===

{{wjacore wobrazy
 | šěrokosć = 60
 | wobraz1 = Yellow card.svg
 | alt1 = Yellow cartouche
 | wobraz2 = Red card.svg
 | alt2 = Red cartouche
 | spódnjaLinka = Players are cautioned with a yellow card and sent off with a red card.
}}
&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
 | šěrokosć = 60
 | wobraz1 = Yellow card.svg
 | alt1 = Yellow cartouche
 | wobraz2 = Red card.svg
 | alt2 = Red cartouche
 | spódnjaLinka = Players are cautioned with a yellow card and sent off with a red card.
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;
{{-}}
{{wjacore wobrazy
 | połoženje = left
 | směr = wertikalny
 | šěrokosć = 200
 | hornjaLinka = [[w:Portable Network Graphics|PNG]] přewidny přikład
 | wobraz1 = PNG transparency demonstration 1.png
 | alt1 = Colored dice with white background
 | wopis1 = A PNG image with an 8-bit transparency layer...
 | wobraz2 = PNG transparency demonstration 2.png
 | alt2 = Colored dice with checkered background
 | wopis2 = ...tu leži nad kašćikatym pozadkom.
}}
&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
