 | wobraz1=Ribbon numeral 2.png | alt1=2
 | wobraz2=Ribbon numeral 3.png | alt2=3
 | wobraz3=Ribbon numeral 4.png | alt3=4
 | spódnjaLinka = When a user has many of one type of [[w:WP:BARN|barnstar]], they can represent them with [[w:WP:RIBBON|ribbons]] and these numerals to indicate the count.
}}
&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
 | šěrokosć = 60
 | wobraz1=Ribbon numeral 2.png | alt1=2
 | wobraz2=Ribbon numeral 3.png | alt2=3
 | wobraz3=Ribbon numeral 4.png | alt3=4
 | spódnjaLinka = When a user has many of one type of [[w:WP:BARN|barnstar]], they can represent them with [[w:WP:RIBBON|ribbons]] and these numerals to indicate the count.
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;
{{-}}

