&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;{{-}}

====Using ''direction''====
By default, the images the template presents are displayed horizontally, as a row (see left; equivalent to setting {{mono|&lt;nowiki&gt;|směr=horicontalny&lt;/nowiki&gt;}}). To display them vertically, i.e. as a column, set {{mono|&lt;nowiki&gt;|směr=wertikalny&lt;/nowiki&gt;}} (see right).
{{wjacore wobrazy
 |połoženje=left |směr=horicontalny |hornjaLinka=(horicontalny) |šěrokosć=60
 |wobraz1=Ribbon numeral 2.png |wobraz2=Ribbon numeral 3.png |wobraz3=Ribbon numeral 4.png
}}
{{wjacore wobrazy
 |połoženje=right |směr=wertikalny |hornjaLinka=(wertikalny) |šěrokosć=60
 |wobraz1=Ribbon numeral 2.png |wobraz2=Ribbon numeral 3.png |wobraz3=Ribbon numeral 4.png
}}
{{-}}

====To match image heights====
:''Note: The following is unnecessary if all the images presented by the template have the same [[w:Aspect ratio (image)|aspect ratio]]; if so, simply set &lt;span style{{=}}&quot;font-family:monospace;font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;width&lt;/span&gt; accordingly.''

* Decide on a total width for all the images, say 320px
* Examine the individual image pages to obtain the full resolution. For example:
** [[:File:Donkey in Clovelly, North Devon, England.jpg]] shows &quot;Donkey in Clovelly, North Devon, England.jpg (750 × 536 pixels, file size: 125 KB, MIME type: image/jpeg)&quot;
** [[:File:Rainbow trout.png]] shows &quot;Rainbow_trout.png (300 × 300 pixels, file size: 158 KB, MIME type: image/png)&quot;
* Specify the full width and height for each image, of the form:
** {{para|šěrokosć1}} {{para|wysokosć1}}  {{para|šěrokosć2}} {{para|wysokosć2}}
* Set the total width using {{para|dospołna_šěrokosć}}

{{wjacore wobrazy
 | połoženje = right
 | dospołna_šěrokosć = 320

 | wobraz1 = Donkey in Clovelly, North Devon, England.jpg
 | width1 = 750 | height1 = 536
 | alt1 = A donkey
 | wopis1 = Rectangular image of a donkey, originally 536 pixels high.

 | wobraz2 = Rainbow_trout.png
 | width2 = 300 | height2 = 300
 | alt2 = A trout
 | wopis2 = Square image of a trout, originally 300 pixels high.

 | spódnjaLinka = Both images have been rendered with the same height, and a total width of 320px
}}
&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy
 | połoženje = right
 | dospołna_šěrokosć = 320

 | wobraz1 = Donkey in Clovelly, North Devon, England.jpg
 | width1 = 750 | height1 = 536
 | alt1 = A donkey
 | wopis1 = Rectangular image of a donkey, originally 536 pixels high.

 | wobraz2 = Rainbow_trout.png
 | width2 = 300 | height2 = 300
 | alt2 = A trout
 | wopis2 = Square image of a trout, originally 300 pixels high.

 | spódnjaLinka = Both images have been rendered with the same height, and a total width of 320px
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;
{{-}}

==== Multiple rows ====
To create an array of images, with multiple rows, use {{para|perrow}}.  The value passed to {{para|perrow}} may be a single number, or a list of numbers delimited by &lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt;.  This feature may also be combined with {{para|dospołna_šěrokosć}} for multiple rows of images with the same total width.
{{wjacore wobrazy|perrow = 2|dospołna_šěrokosć=300
| wobraz1 = Kern_Theodolit_DKM2-A.jpg  |šěrokosć1=319|wysokosć1=425
| wobraz2 = Total-Robotic-Station.jpg  |šěrokosć2=1728|wysokosć2=3072
| wobraz3 = DumpyLevel.jpg  |šěrokosć3=1600|wysokosć3=1200
| wobraz4 = GPS_Survey_Equipment_at_Weir_Dyke_Bridge_-_geograph.org.uk_-_336908.jpg|šěrokosć4=427|wysokosć4=640
| spódnjaLinka = Surveying Equipment. Clockwise from upper left: Optical Theodolite, Robotic total station, Optical level, [[w:Real-time kinematic|RTK]] GPS Base station.
}}
&lt;syntaxhighlight lang=&quot;wikitext&quot; style=&quot;overflow:auto&quot;&gt;
{{wjacore wobrazy|perrow = 2|dospołna_šěrokosć=300
| wobraz1 = Kern_Theodolit_DKM2-A.jpg  |šěrokosć1=319|wysokosć1=425
| wobraz2 = Total-Robotic-Station.jpg  |šěrokosć2=1728|wysokosć2=3072
| wobraz3 = DumpyLevel.jpg  |šěrokosć3=1600|wysokosć3=1200
| wobraz4 = GPS_Survey_Equipment_at_Weir_Dyke_Bridge_-_geograph.org.uk_-_336908.jpg|šěrokosć4=427|wysokosć4=640
| spódnjaLinka = Surveying Equipment. Clockwise from upper left: Optical Theodolite, Robotic total station, Optical level, [[w:Real-time kinematic|RTK]] GPS Base station.
}}
&lt;/syntaxhighlight&gt;
{{-}}

