&lt;pre&gt;
# {{lb|pl|idiom|vulgar}} to [[bother]]; to [[pester]] {{+obj|pl|dat&lt;someone&gt; + :o(acc/loc)&lt;about something&gt;}}
&lt;/pre&gt;
# {{lb|pl|idiom|vulgar}} to [[bother]]; to [[pester]] {{+obj|pl|dat&lt;someone&gt; + :o(acc/loc)&lt;about something&gt;}}
