# {{lb|az|intransitive}} to [[be]] [[notable]] {{+obj|az|::üçün&lt;for&gt;}}
&lt;/pre&gt;
# {{lb|az|intransitive}} to [[be]] [[notable]] {{+obj|az|::üçün&lt;for&gt;}}
