&lt;pre&gt;
# to [[go against]], [[attack]], [[invade]] {{+obj|grc|dat|acc&lt;q:rarely&gt;}}
&lt;/pre&gt;
# to [[go against]], [[attack]], [[invade]] {{+obj|grc|dat|acc&lt;q:rarely&gt;}}
