* {{m+|ar|أهوى}}
&lt;pre&gt;
# to make [[fall]], to [[take down]], to [[blow]] into {{+obj|ar|:بِ&lt;what thing&gt; + :إِلَى/:عَلَى&lt;onto what&gt;}}
&lt;/pre&gt;
